# 22. Form and validation standards

- Validate on blur and submission.
- Use clear inline error messages.
- Disable submit while processing.
- Preserve entered values when navigating back in multi-step forms.
- Show progress and a review step.
- Use conditional fields without losing unrelated data.
- Mark optional fields explicitly.
- Include realistic limits for titles, summaries, budgets, and attachments.
- Ensure numeric shares and monetary amounts are valid.
- Prevent deadlines before start dates.
- Prevent application submission when mandatory documents are missing.
- Show why an action is disabled.
- Use BDT by default and support display of foreign currencies for scholarships.
- Format dates in the Asia/Dhaka context.

