# 27. Responsive behavior

Test at minimum:

- 360 px mobile
- 768 px tablet
- 1024 px laptop
- 1440 px desktop

Rules:

- No horizontal overflow.
- Portal tables must remain usable on mobile through horizontal scroll with sticky first column or card conversion.
- Filter sidebars become drawers on mobile.
- Sticky desktop sidebars become off-canvas on mobile.
- Multi-column forms collapse to one column.
- Primary CTA remains easy to reach.
- Charts remain legible and may simplify labels on narrow screens.
- Modal content must scroll within the viewport.

